Key Technical Evidence: Three Main Characteristics of a Weak Rebound
Previous High Pressure Highlighted: After the pullback from the high of 144.78, there has been no effective second attempt to surge, and the bulls lack the motivation to push hard;
Weak Rebound Strength: Since the rebound from the low of 121.02, the upward momentum has remained insufficient, and the pattern fully conforms to the typical characteristics of a 'weak rebound in a downward trend,' lacking the foundation for sustained upward attack;
